32:18.291 --> 32:26.189
[SPEAKER_01]: far? You really have to be more gentle with your body and doing a short trip. Even you go for two months in Himalaya, you really want to take

32:26.229 --> 32:35.094
[SPEAKER_00]: benefit of every single day. But we have time. So if I need a week of rest, I take a week of rest. If I need to cycle only 40 kilometers, I cycle only 40

32:35.134 --> 32:45.373
[SPEAKER_00]: kilometers. I'm not following any ego stuff on doing 200 kilometers every day for four years. I'm not... ego-minded. I really want to keep my

32:45.413 --> 32:55.506
[SPEAKER_00]: body functioning to keep my dream going. So sometimes I do 150 and the other I feel totally tired so I stop two days and I just swim in the lake.

32:55.607 --> 33:05.856
[SPEAKER_00]: It's just my own decision. So for me keeping my body in a good shape is the priority. I think this resonates. Is there a free spirit culture in

33:05.936 --> 33:14.139
