33:24.883 --> 33:34.330
[SPEAKER_00]: whatever they want. And no one has to tell you what you have to do. And we are very careful to keep our freedom. And it's something when I'm

33:34.370 --> 33:44.857
[SPEAKER_00]: traveling as a woman and I see the few freedoms the women have over the world. I'm not speaking especially about India. But I feel how much, how

33:44.977 --> 33:59.426
[SPEAKER_00]: big is my freedom. How lucky I am to feel it. I'm legitimate to have it and legitimate to contribute to it, while most of women don't see that. So

33:59.466 --> 34:10.932
[SPEAKER_00]: yeah, we have this spirit in France. I think you're living it to the fullest and making the community proud by actually putting it to use. I

