38:58.131 --> 39:04.694
[SPEAKER_01]: you ever get into trouble taking GPS across borders because different countries have different jurisdictions and rules around them? So how

39:04.714 --> 39:13.118
[SPEAKER_01]: does traveling with a garment look like? You have to hide it all the time. Not all the time and most of the time. I fold it in aluminum, fold and put it

39:13.178 --> 39:23.823
